The legal corpus in work/corpus/ is a Markdown conversion of official Peruvian legislative,
administrative and judicial texts obtained from public sources. Under Article 9 of Legislative
Decree 822 (Peruvian Copyright Law), official texts of a legislative, administrative or judicial
nature are not protected by copyright. They are redistributed here so that the evaluation can be
reproduced; CC BY 4.0 applies only to the conversion, not to the underlying texts.
